ll},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_19","text":"I scoped the place out earlier, but there's just no damn spot that'd work.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_20","text":"Just because an area is quiet doesn't mean the plan can be executed discreetly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_21","text":"Our target never goes anywhere without at least two bodyguards.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_22","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_22","text":"Exia pulls up footage on the monitor right on cue—there he is, chatting with someone in the Drink Zone, with two bodyguards by his side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_23","text":"We'll need to subdue the bodyguards... or at the very least, separate them for a moment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_24","text":"... There are more than just those two.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_25","text":"Pardon? Surely not...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_26","text":"On the first day the target visited Coin Rush,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_27","text":"he arrived with a detail of bodyguards, which led to complaints from other guests.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_28","text":"Since then, he only brings two bodyguards with him. The rest wait in one of the participants' waiting rooms.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_29","text":"... I think I saw them before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_30","text":"When I wanted to get changed earlier, I opened the waiting room door","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_31","text":"and saw some big guys in black suits.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_32","text":"Do you remember how many?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_33","text":"There were probably at least twenty of them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_34","text":"Hmm...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_35","text":"... That's a lot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_36","text":"They're not glued to him or anything, so if we pick the right spot, we can still pull this off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_37","text":"Hey, Exia, you done yet or what?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,