, I observed the same.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_45","text":"Moreover, it seemed that guests would visit him periodically to engage in conversation before departing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_46","text":"Based on what we know about the target,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_47","text":"his occasional rounds are probably to find new business partners.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_48","text":"That's when he caught my attention.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_49","text":"So, where do we jump him...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_50","text":"Definitely not the Drink Zone. Way too crowded.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm