,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_57","text":"Even his bathroom breaks are done on a schedule.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_58","text":"Each time he goes, those hulking guys from the waiting room come out","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_59","text":"and stand guard the entire way to the restroom, and even inside it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_60","text":"Seriously, what an unbelievable guy...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_61","text":"This is... probably how he survived out in the Outer Rim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_62","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_62","text":"... True that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_63","text":"So, how do we lure him?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_64","text":"Just waltz up to him and ask if he wants to hang out?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_65","text":"... This man isn't here to have fun. He's here on business.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_66","text":"Pretty sure that would only make him put his guard up further.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_67","text":"Then why not use that business as an excuse?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_68","text":"Pal, you can just go up and talk to him like you're some big shot businessman.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_69","text":"I do believe it's feasible, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_70","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_70","text":"Ade looks at me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_71","text":"However, should he have seen Master's face before, he would recognize him immediately.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_72","text":"I believe it's quite likely he knows, given his close ties to the Central Government.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_73","text":"Yes, but that doesn't mean we can go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_74","text":"That's right, everyone here is well-known except Exia.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_75","text":"... So, how about this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_76","text":"We walk past the target and \"accidentally\" spill a drink on his clothes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_77","text":"That way, he'll go to the restroom outside of his usual schedule.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_78","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_78","text":"... That's not a bad idea.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_79","text":"Yes, I believe that is an excellent idea.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_80","text":"Above all, the fact that we may choose the timing of our action is especially advantageous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_81","text":"Precisely. That minimizes the variables.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"rouge_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_82","text":"... But what if the target just stays put? Or even heads home?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_83","text":"We'll cross that bridge when we come to it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_84","text":"It's not like I've got any better ideas anyway.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_85","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_85","text":"... First, let's flesh out Bay's proposal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_86","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_86","text":"Exia, find the best time window to lure him to the restroom.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_87","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_87","text":"We'll head to the Drink Zone and get a sense of the layout and routes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_88","text":"Oooh, since you're heading to the Drink Zone,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_89","text":"could you bring me a drink on your way back?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinsinrush1_04_s_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinsinrush1_04_s_90","text":"I swear, sometimes I just wanna smack her upside the head.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}